l,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119256","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119256","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119256.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119256.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for new contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n-->\r\nFixes #117548 fixes #110313.\r\n\r\n## Problem\r\n\r\nAutocompletion suggests items from outer classes even when the type is an attribute. However, constant members of an outer class are only accessible inside an inner class body and not as an attribute.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nDo not visit outer classes when completion type is `COMPLETION_ATTRIBUTE`.\r\n\r\nThe fix adds a new parameter that when true, visits outer classes. All existing call sites have it set to true, except for the attribute/attribute method completion one that this PR addresses. \r\n\r\nI am open to ideas on better ways to implement this. Adding another boolean flag is not ideal but I don't see a simpler way to implement it without refactoring the existing system.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119256/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119256/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}